  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e03-scene-17",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "撤回报案  (Withdrawing the Police Report)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Continuing in the hospital corridor, Chun Yuqiao pieces together why Li Mingji panicked onstage and demands that the singer's manager clear Bu Xiaogu immediately. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天晚上的舞台上，李铭基没有看到宝石。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "所以他一上台的时候，心里就已经开始恐慌了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我跟抢救的医生谈过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在我管理的演播厅里，舞台上多了一根针我都会清楚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你要是不相信的话，我有监控录像，随时可以调给你看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "淳于总可真会编故事啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你没有证据，就算李哥醒过来也不会承认的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "堂堂的老牌歌星，因为舞台恐惧症没有办法完成演出。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这样的消息传出去会怎样？我们可以找律师一起谈一谈。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "撤回报案，更改你们团队的声明。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "把我的人从警局里放出来。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天晚上的舞台上，李铭基没有看到宝石。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On tonight's stage, Li Mingji did not see the gemstone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "所以他一上台的时候，心里就已经开始恐慌了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So the moment he stepped onstage, panic had already started in his heart.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我跟抢救的医生谈过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have already spoken with the emergency doctors.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在我管理的演播厅里，舞台上多了一根针我都会清楚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In the studio I run, I notice even a single extra needle on the stage.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你要是不相信的话，我有监控录像，随时可以调给你看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you doubt me, I have security footage I can pull up for you anytime.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "淳于总可真会编故事啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao really knows how to make up stories.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你没有证据，就算李哥醒过来也不会承认的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have no proof, and even when Brother Li wakes up he will not admit it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "堂堂的老牌歌星，因为舞台恐惧症没有办法完成演出。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A celebrated veteran singer unable to finish a show because of stage fright.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这样的消息传出去会怎样？我们可以找律师一起谈一谈。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happens if word like that gets out? Bring your lawyers and let us talk.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "撤回报案，更改你们团队的声明。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Withdraw the police report and revise your team's public statement.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "把我的人从警局里放出来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have my staff member released from the police station.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天晚上的舞台上，李铭基没有看到宝石。",
      "gap": 0.5
