      "t": "这样的消息传出去会怎样？我们可以找律师一起谈一谈。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "撤回报案，更改你们团队的声明。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "把我的人从警局里放出来。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Backed by doctor reports and studio cameras, Yuqiao forces Li Mingji's team to drop the false police report and free Xiaogu. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
